{
  "uid": "nal-service-overview",
  "title": "net-assurance-lab - Service Overview",
  "description": "Throughput, loss and RTT percentiles for every scenario of the latest net-assurance-lab run.",
  "tags": [
    "net-assurance-lab",
    "prometheus"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## net-assurance-lab - service overview\n\nMetrics come from the lab exporter (`nal_*`), which re-reads `results/latest` on every Prometheus scrape. Values describe the **most recent finished run** and stay constant between runs; re-running `./run_lab.sh` refreshes every panel. Scenarios: `baseline_burst`, `baseline_sustained` (healthy path), `fault_sustained` (injected loss/delay/flap), `malformed` (parser robustness)."
      },
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Loss ratio by scenario",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "nal_loss_ratio",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Valid-stream loss ratio per scenario from the exported run.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "RTT p99 by scenario (ms)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "nal_rtt_ms{stat=\"p99\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
